      "writtenOn": "2020-09-10T17:08:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Replace with call to syv682x_discharge_vbus.\n\nOne issue I see here is that we will be discharging when the new source is connected. Does that cause issues? We will be drawing current before vSafe5V. If there are multiple sources, we don\u0027t enable the sink on one of them so we will have a similar issue.\n\nThat dissipated power is significant.",
